{"seq":19,"slug":"feature-flags-progressive-delivery","title":"特性开关与渐进交付","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery","rating":{"composite":4.28,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"特性开关与渐进交付\">特性开关与渐进交付</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>特性开关（Feature Flags）与渐进交付（Progressive Delivery）是现代软件工程中将<strong>代码部署</strong>与<strong>功能发布</strong>解耦的核心技术体系。通过在运行时动态控制功能的可见性与可用性，团队可以在不重新部署的前提下，精细地管理用户体验、降低发布风险、加速产品迭代。</p>\n<p>这一实践从 Facebook 2008 年的 Gatekeeper 系统开始，经过 Netflix、Google、Microsoft 等公司的大规模验证，如今已成为 DevOps 与持续交付流水线中不可或缺的基础设施。2014 年 LaunchDarkly 的创立标志着特性管理成为独立的工程领域，而 2023 年 CNCF 孵化的 OpenFeature 标准则推动了供应商无关的统一 API 生态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心理念\">核心理念</h2><p><strong>部署 ≠ 发布。</strong> 传统模式中，部署代码即意味着向所有用户暴露新功能；一旦出现缺陷，影响面是全量用户。特性开关打破了这一耦合——代码持续部署到生产环境，但新功能隐藏在开关之后，由产品或运维团队根据业务节奏和监控信号决定何时、向谁、以多大比例开放。</p>\n<p>渐进交付（Progressive Delivery）在此基础上引入自动化决策：基于生产环境的真实信号（延迟、错误率、业务指标），系统自动推进或回滚灰度进程，将人工判断转化为数据驱动的闭环控制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的知识结构\">本 Hub 的知识结构</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>关键内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一章：基础概念</td>\n<td>开关分类与生命周期</td>\n<td>四类开关（发布/实验/运维/权限）、生命周期管理、目标定向规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二章：渐进交付策略</td>\n<td>发布模式</td>\n<td>金丝雀发布、蓝绿/环形部署、百分比灰度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三章：工程实现</td>\n<td>SDK 与评估引擎</td>\n<td>SDK 架构、性能优化、测试策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第四章：运营治理</td>\n<td>平台与治理</td>\n<td>技术债管理、可观测性集成、平台选型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与其他知识域的关系\">与其他知识域的关系</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>CI/CD 流水线</strong>：特性开关嵌入持续交付流程，实现代码部署与功能发布的分离</li>\n<li><strong>可观测性</strong>：开关变更与指标关联是自动化灰度决策的基础</li>\n<li><strong>站点可靠性工程</strong>：运维开关（Kill Switch）是事故响应的第一道防线</li>\n<li><strong>混沌工程</strong>：在渐进交付中注入故障实验以验证系统韧性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径建议\">学习路径建议</h2><ol>\n<li>先掌握<strong>开关分类与生命周期</strong>（第一章），理解不同类型开关的设计意图与管理策略</li>\n<li>学习<strong>渐进交付模式</strong>（第二章），掌握金丝雀、蓝绿等具体发布策略</li>\n<li>深入<strong>工程实现</strong>（第三章），理解 SDK 架构、性能约束与测试方法</li>\n<li>最后关注<strong>运营治理</strong>（第四章），建立可持续的开关管理体系与平台选型能力</li>\n</ol>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础概念","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feature-flag-fundamentals","title":"特性开关基础：类型分类与核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/foundations/feature-flag-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"flag-lifecycle-management","title":"开关生命周期管理：从创建到消亡的全流程治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/foundations/flag-lifecycle-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"targeting-segmentation","title":"目标定向与分群：精细控制功能可见性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/foundations/targeting-segmentation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"progressive-delivery","title":"渐进交付策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/progressive-delivery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"canary-releases","title":"金丝雀发布：流量切分、健康指标与自动回滚","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/progressive-delivery/canary-releases"},{"seq":2,"slug":"blue-green-ring-deployments","title":"蓝绿部署与环形发布：多环策略与流量路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/progressive-delivery/blue-green-ring-deployments"},{"seq":3,"slug":"percentage-rollout-strategies","title":"百分比灰度策略：粘性哈希、渐进提升与紧急 Kill Switch","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/progressive-delivery/percentage-rollout-strategies"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"engineering","title":"工程实现","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sdk-architecture-patterns","title":"SDK 架构模式：客户端与服务端的评估引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/engineering/sdk-architecture-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"flag-evaluation-performance","title":"开关评估性能：延迟优化与规则引擎设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/engineering/flag-evaluation-performance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"testing-with-flags","title":"特性开关下的测试：组合爆炸与策略矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/engineering/testing-with-flags"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运营治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"governance-technical-debt","title":"治理与技术债：开关数量控制、过期策略与代码清理自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/operations/governance-technical-debt"},{"seq":2,"slug":"observability-flag-impact","title":"可观测性与影响分析：开关变更到指标关联的闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/operations/observability-flag-impact"},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-comparison","title":"平台对比与选型：从自建到商业方案的决策框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/operations/platform-comparison"}]}]}